  note    the zones of North America read as RFC 5322 § 4.3 says, as Python reads them (Go reads `EST` as UTC); `-0000`, a military letter and a missing zone mean an offset unknown, as Python's naive answer says (Go refuses a missing zone); `Z` is UTC, as Python reads it; an hour of 24, a second of 60 and an offset of 24 hours are refused, as Python refuses them; a weekday that is not the date's is read, as both read it

